{"id":"n3-010","title":"～きり","romaji":"〜kiri","jlptLevel":3,"shortExplanation":"Expresses the idea of 'only', 'since', or 'after'.","longExplanation":"The ～きり grammar point is used to express the idea of 'only', 'since', or 'after'. It indicates that a certain action or state continues without any change since a specific point in time or after a certain event. It is commonly used with verbs in the past tense, but can also be used with other forms.","formation":"Verb-past + きり, Verb-てform + きり (less common), Noun + きり","examples":[{"jp":"彼は出かけたきり帰ってきません。","romaji":"Kare wa dekaketa kiri kaette kimasen.","en":"He went out and hasn't come back since.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"出かけ","vocabId":"1598550","reading":"でかける","baseForm":"出かける"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"きり","vocabId":"1531110","reading":"きり"},{"surface":"帰っ","vocabId":"1221270","reading":"かえる","baseForm":"帰る"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"き","vocabId":"1221520","reading":"き","baseForm":"くる"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4]},{"jp":"昨日コーヒーを飲んだきり、何も飲まなかった。","romaji":"Kinou koohii wo nonda kiri, nani mo nomanakatta.","en":"I haven't had anything to drink since the coffee I had yesterday.","words":[{"surface":"昨日","vocabId":"1579260","reading":"きのう"},{"surface":"コーヒー","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"飲ん","vocabId":"1169870","reading":"のむ","baseForm":"飲む"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"きり","vocabId":"1531110","reading":"きり"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"何","vocabId":"1577100","reading":"なに"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"飲ま","vocabId":"1169870","reading":"のむ","baseForm":"飲む"},{"surface":"なかっ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ない"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5]},{"jp":"卒業したきり、彼女に会っていません。","romaji":"Sotsugyou shita kiri, kanojo ni atte imasen.","en":"I haven't seen her since we graduated.","words":[{"surface":"卒業","vocabId":"1405890","reading":"そつぎょう"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"きり","vocabId":"1531110","reading":"きり"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"会っ","vocabId":"1198180","reading":"あう","baseForm":"会う"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3]},{"jp":"その映画を見たきり、もう一度見たいと思っています。","romaji":"Sono eiga wo mita kiri, mou ichido mitai to omotteimasu.","en":"I've wanted to watch that movie again ever since I saw it.","words":[{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"映画","vocabId":"1173720","reading":"えいが"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"見","vocabId":"1259290","reading":"みる","baseForm":"見る"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"きり","vocabId":"1531110","reading":"きり"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"もう一度","vocabId":"2005860","reading":"もういちど"},{"surface":"見","vocabId":"1259290","reading":"みる","baseForm":"見る"},{"surface":"たい","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"思っ","vocabId":"1589350","reading":"おもう","baseForm":"思う"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5]}],"formalityLevel":"neutral","usageNote":"\"Only/since then\" - a one-time event with a lasting effect, similar to たきり but broader (also means \"only\").","family":{"id":"sequence-after","name":"Sequence (After / As A Result)","relatedPoints":["n3-036","n2-068","n2-175","n2-038","n2-179","n2-185","n5-048","n5-038"]}}